1
00:00:01,416 --> 00:00:05,658
(Episode 5)

2
00:00:14,462 --> 00:00:15,830
How much is it for two?

3
00:00:15,830 --> 00:00:18,393
Hello,
that would be three and a half dollars.

4
00:00:18,393 --> 00:00:19,546
For how long is it open?

5
00:00:19,546 --> 00:00:21,798
It is open until 5 p.m.

6
00:00:21,798 --> 00:00:22,798
Thank you.

7
00:00:56,464 --> 00:00:58,099
It looks exactly like your painting.

8
00:01:14,101 --> 00:01:17,928
Jun Seo, is that Tae Seok?

9
00:01:21,822 --> 00:01:22,822
What?

10
00:01:24,677 --> 00:01:25,760
Han Tae Seok.

11
00:01:35,965 --> 00:01:37,208
The girl...

12
00:01:39,444 --> 00:01:41,555
Are you talking about your room attendant?

13
00:01:42,172 --> 00:01:43,831
It hurts.

14
00:01:54,692 --> 00:01:57,135
You are such a good guy as a friend,

15
00:01:58,212 --> 00:01:59,655
but what is wrong with you?

16
00:02:00,812 --> 00:02:02,181
Why do you behave like this?

17
00:02:03,716 --> 00:02:04,716
Why are you...

18
00:02:06,356 --> 00:02:07,397
I am sorry.

19
00:02:11,330 --> 00:02:14,029
But do you know how sometimes,
you get me really upset?

20
00:02:16,706 --> 00:02:18,484
She was a nice girl.

21
00:02:20,465 --> 00:02:21,972
If you are just playing around,
stop right now.

22
00:02:22,914 --> 00:02:23,932
I'm serious.

23
00:02:26,809 --> 00:02:27,940
I am serious.

24
00:02:30,514 --> 00:02:31,541
It is the first time.

25
00:02:33,517 --> 00:02:36,720
What are you doing?
Aren't you going to draw me?

26
00:02:54,796 --> 00:02:56,028
Is this me?

27
00:02:57,507 --> 00:02:59,244
It looks strange.

28
00:03:00,859 --> 00:03:02,188
Don't you think so, Tae Seok?

29
00:03:05,706 --> 00:03:07,445
It looks all right to me.

30
00:03:51,445 --> 00:03:52,445
Choi Eun Seo?

31
00:04:04,462 --> 00:04:05,710
Is it Eun Seo?

32
00:04:09,133 --> 00:04:10,285
Are you Eun Seo?

33
00:04:12,116 --> 00:04:13,287
Are you Jun Seo?

34
00:04:15,229 --> 00:04:16,895
Are you really my brother?

35
00:04:22,381 --> 00:04:23,381
Eun Seo.

36
00:04:40,388 --> 00:04:43,790
The mood is quite weird.
I couldn't serve coffee to them.

37
00:04:45,679 --> 00:04:47,968
How come he didn't recognize her?

38
00:04:49,288 --> 00:04:52,965
He said she was his cousin.
Do you know her well?

39
00:04:52,965 --> 00:04:54,177
What does she do?

40
00:04:56,486 --> 00:04:58,137
Why do you care what she does?

41
00:05:01,590 --> 00:05:02,678
Who is he?

42
00:05:02,678 --> 00:05:05,710
I am a friend of Jun Seo
and Shin Yu Mi's first love.

43
00:05:05,710 --> 00:05:07,399
I am also the boyfriend
of the girl inside.

44
00:05:11,094 --> 00:05:12,578
Ji Hwan.

45
00:05:14,806 --> 00:05:16,202
What is wrong with you?

46
00:05:16,583 --> 00:05:18,415
He is annoying.

47
00:05:18,415 --> 00:05:20,176
I have enough headaches already.

48
00:05:23,239 --> 00:05:24,926
Is she really his cousin?

49
00:05:24,926 --> 00:05:27,325
That's what he said.

50
00:05:27,325 --> 00:05:29,350
By the way, is it true?

51
00:05:29,350 --> 00:05:31,040
Do you like her?

52
00:05:37,007 --> 00:05:40,016
What is going on between Jun Seo and her?

53
00:05:48,406 --> 00:05:49,668
- I...
- I...

54
00:05:55,745 --> 00:05:57,004
I didn't know.

55
00:06:00,601 --> 00:06:03,485
If I had known you were the one
who brought my sleepwear,

56
00:06:07,666 --> 00:06:10,429
and charged my cell phone at the hotel...

57
00:06:13,441 --> 00:06:17,476
I didn't know, either.

58
00:06:21,960 --> 00:06:23,077
Eun Seo.

59
00:06:26,851 --> 00:06:28,181
How have you been?

60
00:06:32,850 --> 00:06:34,357
I've been well.

61
00:06:35,050 --> 00:06:36,724
Mom and my brother have treated me well.

62
00:06:40,498 --> 00:06:46,146
My brother is still fighting people.

63
00:06:46,146 --> 00:06:49,060
But he doesn't hit me, at least.

64
00:07:00,233 --> 00:07:04,388
I heard you moved to Seoul
because of the debt your family owed.

65
00:07:06,450 --> 00:07:07,551
I see...

66
00:07:11,076 --> 00:07:13,253
We didn't have enough money,

67
00:07:13,253 --> 00:07:15,015
but we were poor to begin with.

68
00:07:16,188 --> 00:07:20,117
Despite it all, we've been doing well
helping each other out.

69
00:07:20,117 --> 00:07:22,047
I was loved very much.

70
00:07:23,173 --> 00:07:24,997
You know I'm clever.

71
00:07:24,997 --> 00:07:26,679
I've been happy.

72
00:07:30,588 --> 00:07:32,079
Have you been worried?

73
00:07:34,915 --> 00:07:36,887
Have you been worried about me?

74
00:07:42,708 --> 00:07:44,270
Have you been worried about me a lot?

75
00:07:48,772 --> 00:07:50,015
I've been worried a lot.

76
00:07:59,644 --> 00:08:05,272
Are Mom and Dad still in the U.S.?

77
00:08:07,484 --> 00:08:10,931
Yes, they are doing great.

78
00:08:10,931 --> 00:08:13,822
They are in the U.S. now,
but they are coming back soon.

79
00:08:17,891 --> 00:08:19,261
I miss them.

80
00:08:23,330 --> 00:08:24,862
I've missed you.

81
00:08:26,364 --> 00:08:28,803
I've been thinking of you a lot
these days.

82
00:08:28,803 --> 00:08:30,757
Maybe it was because
I was going to meet you.

83
00:08:34,715 --> 00:08:38,436
It is so great to see you.
I didn't think I would meet you again.

84
00:08:38,436 --> 00:08:41,189
I am so glad.

85
00:09:02,952 --> 00:09:04,180
This is great.

86
00:09:20,069 --> 00:09:21,188
Are they gone?

87
00:09:21,657 --> 00:09:24,238
Yes, Tae Seok will give her a ride.

88
00:09:24,238 --> 00:09:27,709
You should have taken her home,
rather than worry about me.

89
00:09:27,709 --> 00:09:28,719
That's fine.

90
00:09:30,861 --> 00:09:33,159
She was pretty and seemed kind.

91
00:09:34,244 --> 00:09:38,244
Were you that happy to see her?

92
00:09:38,244 --> 00:09:40,919
You even had tears in your eyes.

93
00:09:46,390 --> 00:09:47,511
It was so weird.

94
00:09:48,596 --> 00:09:53,775
She was very formal to me.

95
00:09:57,554 --> 00:09:59,780
What time is your flight?

96
00:09:59,780 --> 00:10:02,258
Do you have time for a coffee
before you leave?

97
00:10:02,258 --> 00:10:03,258
Sure.

98
00:10:11,769 --> 00:10:13,139
So, is he your cousin?

99
00:10:17,074 --> 00:10:18,408
Yes.

100
00:10:18,408 --> 00:10:21,218
What a small world.

101
00:10:21,218 --> 00:10:22,697
How could you be a cousin...

102
00:10:22,697 --> 00:10:24,988
of Yoon Jun Seo, of all people?

103
00:10:26,472 --> 00:10:28,060
Let's start from the beginning.

104
00:10:28,060 --> 00:10:31,559
We'll forget everything that happened
between us, and start again.

105
00:10:32,509 --> 00:10:34,086
You and I.

106
00:10:38,067 --> 00:10:40,606
Could you consider me
your brother's best friend?

107
00:10:42,972 --> 00:10:45,138
By the way, I'm in trouble now.

108
00:10:45,138 --> 00:10:48,229
If Jun Seo found out I had you fired,
he wouldn't let me live.

109
00:10:49,018 --> 00:10:51,050
Have you told him about it?

110
00:10:52,890 --> 00:10:55,776
Could you explain it to my manager?

111
00:10:55,776 --> 00:10:59,205
Could you please tell her
nothing happened?

112
00:10:59,205 --> 00:11:00,982
I need to get my job back at the hotel.

113
00:11:00,982 --> 00:11:03,751
I don't want him to know I quit. Please?

114
00:11:04,836 --> 00:11:07,051
I never ask for a favor.

115
00:11:08,896 --> 00:11:10,443
I never did.

116
00:11:14,487 --> 00:11:15,611
I am sorry.

117
00:11:17,185 --> 00:11:18,194
Is that important to you?

118
00:11:20,187 --> 00:11:22,020
Does it matter that much to you?

119
00:11:24,889 --> 00:11:27,755
Please. Ms. Choi Eun Seo
did nothing wrong.

120
00:11:30,032 --> 00:11:32,364
Why do you care after all this time, sir?

121
00:11:35,193 --> 00:11:37,209
Nothing happened that day.

122
00:11:37,209 --> 00:11:38,209
That is true.

123
00:11:42,233 --> 00:11:43,817
Choi Eun Seo.

124
00:11:43,817 --> 00:11:46,601
Did I fire you for the incident that day?

125
00:11:46,601 --> 00:11:49,246
Do you know how many days
you've been absent without notice?

126
00:11:49,246 --> 00:11:52,935
And now you brought a man here to protest?

127
00:11:52,935 --> 00:11:54,536
What?

128
00:11:54,536 --> 00:11:57,351
A man? Protest?

129
00:11:57,351 --> 00:11:58,601
Please leave, sir.

130
00:11:58,601 --> 00:12:00,792
She is a nice girl.

131
00:12:00,792 --> 00:12:02,783
True, I flirted with her
to go out with her.

132
00:12:02,783 --> 00:12:05,470
So what? What is the matter with that?

133
00:12:05,470 --> 00:12:08,045
How could you fire someone
for having a relationship?

134
00:12:08,045 --> 00:12:10,198
- Don't you date anyone?
- Stop it.

135
00:12:10,198 --> 00:12:13,352
I guess no one would date you.

136
00:12:26,197 --> 00:12:27,351
How have you been?

137
00:12:32,180 --> 00:12:33,398
I've been doing great.

138
00:12:34,365 --> 00:12:36,247
My mom and my brother treat me well.

139
00:12:43,721 --> 00:12:46,259
Your brother was really mad.

140
00:12:48,936 --> 00:12:50,804
I will sleep here tonight.

141
00:12:53,753 --> 00:12:55,476
What happened?

142
00:12:56,281 --> 00:13:00,692
Did your brother drag you
to President Kim and...

143
00:13:01,224 --> 00:13:03,118
- Choi Eun Seo, come here.
- What are you doing?

144
00:13:03,118 --> 00:13:04,549
Why are you doing this?

145
00:13:04,549 --> 00:13:06,710
- Get out of my way.
- Jong Chul.

146
00:13:06,710 --> 00:13:08,232
- Stop there.
- Jong Chul.

147
00:13:12,877 --> 00:13:14,083
Get over here.

148
00:13:14,083 --> 00:13:15,802
Jong Chul.

149
00:13:15,802 --> 00:13:18,307
Do you have any idea
what kind of a meeting it was?

150
00:13:18,307 --> 00:13:20,131
How could you run away with a guy?

151
00:13:20,131 --> 00:13:21,236
Jong Chul.

152
00:13:21,236 --> 00:13:23,236
Do you know what you have done to me?

153
00:13:23,236 --> 00:13:26,144
I can't be on a fishing boat anymore.
So, what can I do now?

154
00:13:27,424 --> 00:13:28,429
Jong Chul.

155
00:13:28,429 --> 00:13:29,678
You are a bad man.

156
00:13:29,678 --> 00:13:31,189
What are you? Get out of my face.

157
00:13:31,189 --> 00:13:32,844
What kind of a man are you?
You're terrible.

158
00:13:32,844 --> 00:13:34,462
- Get out of my way.
- Jong Chul.

159
00:13:34,462 --> 00:13:36,165
You jerk.

160
00:13:36,165 --> 00:13:37,468
What are you going to do now?

161
00:13:37,468 --> 00:13:38,671
What will you do?

162
00:13:39,659 --> 00:13:42,173
- Jong Chul.
- You...

163
00:13:44,275 --> 00:13:46,526
- Jong Chul, please.
- Just drop dead here.

164
00:13:46,526 --> 00:13:48,027
You just drop dead.

165
00:13:48,027 --> 00:13:49,105
Just die.

166
00:13:49,105 --> 00:13:50,699
You just die.

167
00:13:50,699 --> 00:13:53,030
You just die now.

168
00:13:53,030 --> 00:13:54,783
All right, let's die together.

169
00:13:54,783 --> 00:13:57,391
- Die, you bastard!
- What are you doing?

170
00:13:57,391 --> 00:13:58,571
What are you doing?

171
00:13:59,577 --> 00:14:01,353
You and I will die together.

172
00:14:01,353 --> 00:14:03,825
I won't just sit still.

173
00:14:03,825 --> 00:14:06,437
Wait and see what I would do to you.

174
00:14:06,860 --> 00:14:08,905
- Jong Chul.
- Mom.

175
00:14:10,822 --> 00:14:12,545
Jong Chul.

176
00:14:19,942 --> 00:14:21,731
Where can you go?

177
00:14:27,399 --> 00:14:29,271
Don't worry, mom!

178
00:14:29,271 --> 00:14:30,889
I have a lot of friends.

179
00:14:33,247 --> 00:14:35,993
What are you going to do
if Jong Chul comes to bother you?

180
00:14:36,864 --> 00:14:39,002
You don't need to worry about me.

181
00:14:47,982 --> 00:14:50,679
Mom, you take this.

182
00:14:50,679 --> 00:14:53,139
Don't give it to Jong Chul.

183
00:14:57,006 --> 00:14:59,536
You will have bruises
on your face tomorrow.

184
00:15:00,991 --> 00:15:03,294
Jong Chul is coming.

185
00:15:03,294 --> 00:15:04,767
Go now. Hurry.

186
00:15:04,767 --> 00:15:06,465
Go before he beats you to death.

187
00:15:51,506 --> 00:15:52,542
Eun Seo.

188
00:15:54,051 --> 00:15:55,188
Jun Seo.

189
00:16:04,090 --> 00:16:05,433
Eun Seo.

190
00:16:05,433 --> 00:16:07,083
Did you get up early?

191
00:16:07,083 --> 00:16:08,645
Did I come too early?

192
00:16:11,355 --> 00:16:13,002
But, you...

193
00:16:13,002 --> 00:16:14,748
I told my family about you.

194
00:16:14,748 --> 00:16:18,259
They told me to stay here for a few days
since it has been so long.

195
00:16:19,103 --> 00:16:22,302
Can I stay here with you for a few days?

196
00:16:22,302 --> 00:16:23,969
Do you have extra space for me?

197
00:16:27,982 --> 00:16:31,672
Did you run away from home?

198
00:16:33,751 --> 00:16:35,487
No.

199
00:16:35,487 --> 00:16:39,176
I guess I made you worry.
I didn't mean to do that.

200
00:16:39,176 --> 00:16:40,472
I will go.

201
00:16:40,472 --> 00:16:42,263
No, it is all right.

202
00:16:43,148 --> 00:16:44,503
Then, can I stay?

203
00:16:46,468 --> 00:16:47,468
Of course.

204
00:16:49,259 --> 00:16:50,374
Come on in.

205
00:17:04,955 --> 00:17:09,317
My brother is still fighting people.

206
00:17:09,317 --> 00:17:12,406
But he doesn't hit me, at least.

207
00:18:03,987 --> 00:18:05,769
- Jun Seo.
- Yes.

208
00:18:07,324 --> 00:18:08,576
I...

209
00:18:11,951 --> 00:18:14,455
actually ran away from home.

210
00:18:14,455 --> 00:18:16,114
I had a fight with my brother.

211
00:18:20,111 --> 00:18:21,961
I am sorry that I lied.

212
00:18:24,168 --> 00:18:27,591
I just thought of you. So...

213
00:18:27,591 --> 00:18:30,482
It is okay. You don't need to tell me.

214
00:18:33,231 --> 00:18:35,194
Stay with me, okay?

215
00:18:36,639 --> 00:18:38,594
I want to stay with you, Eun Seo.

216
00:18:44,720 --> 00:18:45,945
I am looking forward to it.

217
00:18:48,742 --> 00:18:49,915
I will stay for just a few days.

218
00:19:08,689 --> 00:19:10,282
Good night, Eun Seo.

219
00:19:17,239 --> 00:19:18,950
Saying good night...

220
00:19:22,739 --> 00:19:24,213
and good morning,

221
00:19:31,779 --> 00:19:34,237
those are the things
I wanted to say the most.

222
00:19:40,754 --> 00:19:41,754
Jun Seo.

223
00:19:45,300 --> 00:19:46,300
Eun Seo.

224
00:19:51,341 --> 00:19:52,610
Jun Seo.

225
00:19:54,151 --> 00:19:55,450
Jun Seo.

226
00:19:58,799 --> 00:19:59,985
I am sorry.

227
00:20:05,591 --> 00:20:07,331
I am so sorry, Eun Seo.

228
00:20:29,795 --> 00:20:30,952
Are you Mr. Choi Jong Chul?

229
00:20:32,275 --> 00:20:33,275
Yes.

230
00:20:37,476 --> 00:20:38,869
What are you doing?

231
00:20:42,949 --> 00:20:44,108
Who are you?

232
00:20:44,108 --> 00:20:45,254
I am Yoon Jun Seo.

233
00:20:47,092 --> 00:20:51,775
Tell your mother Eun Seo is with me.

234
00:20:54,724 --> 00:20:55,725
You.

235
00:20:56,770 --> 00:20:58,141
Could you be...?

236
00:21:02,802 --> 00:21:04,735
If you ever touch Eun Seo again,

237
00:21:05,852 --> 00:21:07,238
you will be sorry.

238
00:21:15,881 --> 00:21:18,497
What did you buy so much?

239
00:21:18,497 --> 00:21:21,515
I will cook for you.
We will celebrate your first class.

240
00:21:22,344 --> 00:21:24,847
By the way, Eun Seo,

241
00:21:24,847 --> 00:21:28,119
how do we explain to people about us?

242
00:21:28,558 --> 00:21:31,666
You told them we're cousins. I like that.

243
00:21:33,031 --> 00:21:36,663
Your fiancée doesn't even know about me.

244
00:21:36,663 --> 00:21:37,939
So, you have kept things
a secret from her, right?

245
00:21:38,688 --> 00:21:40,120
I...

246
00:21:40,120 --> 00:21:43,624
It's fine. I'm not sure
how Sin Ae would take this.

247
00:21:43,624 --> 00:21:45,968
Let's discuss it when
Mom and Dad are here.

248
00:21:47,344 --> 00:21:48,344
Yes.

249
00:21:49,878 --> 00:21:51,113
Eun Seo,

250
00:21:52,750 --> 00:21:54,842
why are you speaking to me
in a formal way?

251
00:21:56,127 --> 00:21:58,544
I feel a little awkward
because it's been a long time.

252
00:21:59,263 --> 00:22:01,457
Did I speak to you casually before?

253
00:22:05,786 --> 00:22:07,547
How is Sin Ae?

254
00:22:08,762 --> 00:22:09,942
She is well.

255
00:22:10,851 --> 00:22:14,610
She is tough and ambitious.

256
00:22:14,610 --> 00:22:16,761
I think that's why she excelled at school.

257
00:22:16,761 --> 00:22:18,897
When she gets her MBA next month,
she will come to Korea.

258
00:22:18,897 --> 00:22:20,987
I see.

259
00:22:22,690 --> 00:22:25,076
What is an MBA?

260
00:22:29,768 --> 00:22:32,810
She was majoring in business.

261
00:22:32,810 --> 00:22:36,177
It is a master's degree
in business administration, I mean...

262
00:22:36,177 --> 00:22:38,941
It is a sort of certificate of business.

263
00:22:38,941 --> 00:22:40,632
I see.

264
00:22:42,717 --> 00:22:44,646
Tonight's dinner will be great.

265
00:22:44,646 --> 00:22:47,440
I am a good cook.
You can see how good I am.

266
00:22:52,717 --> 00:22:53,833
Jun Seo.

267
00:22:58,510 --> 00:22:59,640
Hello.

268
00:23:03,510 --> 00:23:06,831
Mom packed many different kinds of food.

269
00:23:07,854 --> 00:23:09,968
Help yourself, Eun Seo.

270
00:23:10,574 --> 00:23:13,238
You could've called me.

271
00:23:13,238 --> 00:23:15,047
I wanted to surprise you.

272
00:23:16,094 --> 00:23:18,067
Did you come to spend time with him?

273
00:23:18,067 --> 00:23:19,942
How long are you staying?

274
00:23:22,317 --> 00:23:23,946
I am staying for a few days.

275
00:23:23,946 --> 00:23:25,476
No.

276
00:23:25,476 --> 00:23:27,429
I will let her stay for a while.

277
00:23:27,924 --> 00:23:29,174
Jun Seo.

278
00:23:30,604 --> 00:23:32,965
Finally, you addressed me
like you would a brother.

279
00:23:34,700 --> 00:23:36,557
She has nowhere to stay at the moment.

280
00:23:38,898 --> 00:23:40,915
That is nice, Eun Seo.

281
00:23:40,915 --> 00:23:44,045
I was concerned about
how he takes care of himself,

282
00:23:44,045 --> 00:23:46,204
such as having meals and everything.

283
00:23:46,204 --> 00:23:47,495
Please look after him.

284
00:23:48,914 --> 00:23:51,716
Did you make this kimchi, Eun Seo?

285
00:23:52,427 --> 00:23:53,427
Yes.

286
00:24:01,970 --> 00:24:04,364
She likes it, and wants to learn
how to make it.

287
00:24:08,755 --> 00:24:13,123
You could've told me
you're staying with Eun Seo.

288
00:24:13,123 --> 00:24:14,325
I was embarrassed.

289
00:24:15,362 --> 00:24:16,677
It wasn't planned.

290
00:24:18,891 --> 00:24:20,125
Are you annoyed?

291
00:24:20,644 --> 00:24:23,548
No, if you are with your sister,

292
00:24:23,548 --> 00:24:25,907
I would be relieved.

293
00:24:25,907 --> 00:24:27,494
Also, you can't cheat on me.

294
00:24:30,002 --> 00:24:31,597
I can't cheat on you
even if she's not with me.

295
00:24:32,714 --> 00:24:34,589
I'm not good at dating.

296
00:24:37,535 --> 00:24:40,105
Remember the plan to visit your house
on the weekend?

297
00:24:40,831 --> 00:24:42,298
That's right.

298
00:24:42,958 --> 00:24:45,526
I had all the furniture delivered.

299
00:24:45,526 --> 00:24:46,633
Did you?

300
00:24:47,679 --> 00:24:49,255
You needn't have done that.

301
00:24:49,255 --> 00:24:51,583
I did it because I wanted to.

302
00:24:51,583 --> 00:24:55,146
I will give your parents a good impression
by arranging the house before they come.

303
00:24:56,264 --> 00:24:59,534
Why don't we go with...

304
00:24:59,534 --> 00:25:02,363
Eun Seo and Tae Seok?

305
00:25:05,359 --> 00:25:06,729
Do you want Eun Seo to come with us?

306
00:25:07,183 --> 00:25:11,009
She probably hung out in that house often
when she was young.

307
00:25:17,102 --> 00:25:19,415
- What's wrong?
- What?

308
00:25:19,415 --> 00:25:21,644
Nothing.

309
00:25:21,644 --> 00:25:25,685
I don't think Eun Seo
wants to go to the house.

310
00:25:25,685 --> 00:25:27,654
Let's go, just the two of us.

311
00:25:27,654 --> 00:25:29,945
Or we can go with Tae Seok.

312
00:25:38,793 --> 00:25:39,875
Go in.

313
00:25:41,441 --> 00:25:43,161
I don't want to.

314
00:25:43,161 --> 00:25:45,083
Can you be with me a little longer?

315
00:25:46,794 --> 00:25:48,652
Is Eun Seo waiting for you?

316
00:25:51,049 --> 00:25:53,820
I guess it's dangerous to be there alone.

317
00:25:54,682 --> 00:25:56,572
I think I must say "Good night" at least.

318
00:25:57,609 --> 00:25:59,547
Are you going back
just to say "Good night?"

319
00:26:05,561 --> 00:26:06,780
Okay, fine.

320
00:26:10,521 --> 00:26:11,808
Good night.

321
00:26:12,528 --> 00:26:13,617
Good night.

322
00:26:46,334 --> 00:26:47,400
Jun Seo.

323
00:26:54,205 --> 00:26:55,424
Did you run?

324
00:26:56,214 --> 00:26:57,214
What?

325
00:26:58,761 --> 00:27:00,083
Yes.

326
00:27:00,083 --> 00:27:02,579
Why? Did something happen?

327
00:27:02,579 --> 00:27:03,579
What?

328
00:27:05,092 --> 00:27:06,172
No.

329
00:27:12,458 --> 00:27:14,006
Good night.

330
00:27:15,332 --> 00:27:16,710
I wanted to say that.

331
00:27:20,507 --> 00:27:21,512
Good night.

332
00:27:25,907 --> 00:27:26,907
Jun Seo.

333
00:27:28,322 --> 00:27:29,901
I am so happy...

334
00:27:31,189 --> 00:27:33,934
that I can say "Good night" to you.

335
00:27:40,109 --> 00:27:41,238
Good night.

336
00:28:11,883 --> 00:28:15,411
I may not have much authority,
but do I need to report to you...

337
00:28:15,411 --> 00:28:17,605
when I fire someone?

338
00:28:19,571 --> 00:28:23,003
We have a labor union,
and people can see things.

339
00:28:23,003 --> 00:28:26,139
The act of firing Manager Kim
to reinstate Choi Eun Seo...

340
00:28:26,139 --> 00:28:27,413
Are you saying I can't do that?

341
00:28:30,747 --> 00:28:34,092
Do not provoke me too much.

342
00:28:37,059 --> 00:28:39,267
I have an idea.

343
00:28:39,267 --> 00:28:43,003
If you really dislike Manager Kim,
we can transfer her to another department.

344
00:28:43,003 --> 00:28:46,483
I don't care, all I want is
not to see her again.

345
00:28:47,650 --> 00:28:49,864
I will take care of it.

346
00:28:49,864 --> 00:28:51,234
Do you have any other concerns?

347
00:28:51,234 --> 00:28:52,552
No.

348
00:28:52,552 --> 00:28:53,555
Okay.

349
00:28:54,065 --> 00:28:56,317
- Wait.
- Yes?

350
00:28:56,317 --> 00:28:58,218
You should say "Ms."

351
00:28:58,218 --> 00:28:59,218
Pardon me?

352
00:28:59,218 --> 00:29:00,549
Choi Eun Seo.

353
00:29:01,732 --> 00:29:05,262
You should call her Ms. Choi Eun Seo.

354
00:29:06,803 --> 00:29:07,803
I will.

355
00:29:10,083 --> 00:29:12,427
Is that real? Really?

356
00:29:12,427 --> 00:29:14,099
Of course.

357
00:29:14,099 --> 00:29:16,075
So, come to work.

358
00:29:16,075 --> 00:29:18,351
How did you convince my manager?

359
00:29:19,612 --> 00:29:21,395
Well...

360
00:29:21,395 --> 00:29:22,840
Did you ask her a favor?

361
00:29:24,325 --> 00:29:26,624
You said you wanted your job back.

362
00:29:26,624 --> 00:29:28,829
Did you ask her? Really?

363
00:29:30,360 --> 00:29:31,555
Will you come back?

364
00:29:32,857 --> 00:29:34,199
Thank you.

365
00:29:34,199 --> 00:29:35,650
This is great.

366
00:29:37,768 --> 00:29:38,770
Yes.

367
00:29:39,763 --> 00:29:41,515
Can I start working tomorrow?

368
00:29:42,000 --> 00:29:44,448
Yes, of course you can.

369
00:29:44,448 --> 00:29:47,421
I have been worried so much.
I feel relieved.

370
00:29:50,130 --> 00:29:53,326
If you want to thank me,
let's have a meal.

371
00:29:53,326 --> 00:29:54,352
What do you say?

372
00:29:54,982 --> 00:29:57,630
All right, why not?

373
00:29:57,630 --> 00:30:00,232
Why not?

374
00:30:00,232 --> 00:30:02,442
I could be your brother,
since I am a friend of your brother.

375
00:30:04,110 --> 00:30:08,403
Don't smile at just anybody.

376
00:30:12,162 --> 00:30:13,554
Jun Seo.

377
00:30:16,256 --> 00:30:19,614
I told you that the one who comes first
is the winner.

378
00:30:27,407 --> 00:30:28,475
Hello.

379
00:30:31,206 --> 00:30:32,498
Hello.

380
00:30:37,871 --> 00:30:40,752
What was going on earlier?
I also don't see Manager Kim.

381
00:30:40,752 --> 00:30:42,295
Didn't you know?

382
00:30:42,295 --> 00:30:44,303
She transferred to the pool.

383
00:30:44,303 --> 00:30:47,519
The pool?
The External Development Department?

384
00:30:47,519 --> 00:30:49,207
That means this.

385
00:30:49,207 --> 00:30:50,464
Why?

386
00:30:50,464 --> 00:30:54,681
I don't know.
People say the new director dislikes her.

387
00:30:54,681 --> 00:30:58,049
Poor her. How could the director do that?

388
00:30:58,049 --> 00:31:00,344
It all worked out for you.

389
00:31:00,344 --> 00:31:03,081
You wouldn't have been reinstated
if Manager Kim hadn't been fired.

390
00:31:03,081 --> 00:31:06,473
So, stay low, and be thankful
for what you have now.

391
00:31:06,473 --> 00:31:09,999
That's why things were weird earlier.

392
00:31:09,999 --> 00:31:13,880
Rumor has it that there's something
going on between you and the director.

393
00:31:13,880 --> 00:31:14,882
What?

394
00:31:14,882 --> 00:31:17,706
I know it's nonsense.
How would you even know him?

395
00:31:17,706 --> 00:31:18,721
Isn't it funny?

396
00:31:18,721 --> 00:31:20,049
Who is he?

397
00:31:20,049 --> 00:31:21,970
He is the youngest son of the CEO.

398
00:31:21,970 --> 00:31:25,193
He caused so much trouble in Seoul,
and got transferred here.

399
00:31:25,193 --> 00:31:27,329
It is an open secret.

400
00:31:27,329 --> 00:31:28,329
Is that so?

401
00:31:28,937 --> 00:31:30,450
I wouldn't know him, would I?

402
00:31:30,450 --> 00:31:32,313
Of course not.

403
00:31:32,313 --> 00:31:35,315
What was his name? Han Tae Seok?

404
00:31:37,337 --> 00:31:39,827
What? Han Tae Seok?

405
00:31:41,377 --> 00:31:42,377
Choi Eun Seo.

406
00:31:43,961 --> 00:31:45,349
You came to work.

407
00:31:47,571 --> 00:31:49,061
I have been looking all over for you.

408
00:31:51,506 --> 00:31:52,615
Choi Eun Seo.

409
00:31:53,498 --> 00:31:54,584
Let me go.

410
00:31:55,908 --> 00:31:57,117
What is wrong?

411
00:31:57,117 --> 00:31:58,526
What is the matter if I'm the director?

412
00:31:58,526 --> 00:32:01,007
I'm doing nothing but hanging around,
although I'm the director. You know that.

413
00:32:02,540 --> 00:32:06,492
I thought for a moment that
you might be a good person.

414
00:32:06,492 --> 00:32:09,627
I thought you sincerely apologized
and asked her a favor.

415
00:32:09,627 --> 00:32:11,272
I thought that's how I got my job back.

416
00:32:12,772 --> 00:32:15,165
Who says I didn't apologize?
Who says that?

417
00:32:15,892 --> 00:32:17,627
Would things be different if you know who?

418
00:32:17,627 --> 00:32:19,167
Are you going to fire them, too?

419
00:32:21,195 --> 00:32:22,478
Did the manager say that?

420
00:32:23,427 --> 00:32:24,554
I will not let her...

421
00:32:24,554 --> 00:32:27,765
I know people like you so well.

422
00:32:28,299 --> 00:32:31,005
You care so much when you are hurt,

423
00:32:31,005 --> 00:32:34,740
but you stomp on someone's life
without hesitation.

424
00:32:34,740 --> 00:32:35,870
You disgust me.

425
00:32:37,483 --> 00:32:38,550
You are right.

426
00:32:41,435 --> 00:32:44,212
I am that kind of a person.
I don't care about others at all.

427
00:32:44,212 --> 00:32:46,812
Why would it matter if I stomp on those
who bother me?

428
00:32:46,812 --> 00:32:47,996
What is wrong with that?

429
00:32:50,299 --> 00:32:51,374
I like you.

430
00:32:58,340 --> 00:32:59,807
Yes, I like you.

431
00:33:00,962 --> 00:33:02,637
I did that because I like you.

432
00:33:05,418 --> 00:33:06,670
Are you happy now?

433
00:33:14,356 --> 00:33:17,055
Jun Seo, where do you want this?

434
00:33:22,261 --> 00:33:24,203
It can go there. Give it to me.

435
00:33:32,751 --> 00:33:34,682
Get on. I'll give you a ride.

436
00:33:37,879 --> 00:33:40,993
You had better get on unless you want
to make a scene here again.

437
00:33:47,965 --> 00:33:50,231
- What I said.
- I know.

438
00:33:50,231 --> 00:33:53,025
I know you said that
due to losing your temper.

439
00:33:55,614 --> 00:33:57,976
I will not say anything to my brother.
Don't worry.

440
00:34:01,485 --> 00:34:02,999
What are you doing?

441
00:34:02,999 --> 00:34:05,355
Let's go tell him.

442
00:34:05,355 --> 00:34:08,594
Tell your brother that I like you.

443
00:34:10,079 --> 00:34:11,605
Then you will believe me.

444
00:34:11,605 --> 00:34:14,512
- Look.
- Fasten your seatbelt. We'll go far.

445
00:35:02,442 --> 00:35:03,963
Is it your hometown, too?

446
00:35:07,027 --> 00:35:08,299
What are you looking at?

447
00:35:09,010 --> 00:35:11,708
Haven't you been here often?
It's not that far.

448
00:35:15,883 --> 00:35:17,156
I haven't.

449
00:35:24,006 --> 00:35:27,105
This is great. It is so clean.

450
00:35:30,272 --> 00:35:31,634
Is it not your first time here?

451
00:35:34,102 --> 00:35:37,465
Jun Seo was here until middle school
before he went to the U.S.

452
00:35:37,465 --> 00:35:40,402
He always talked about this house
while he was in the U.S.

453
00:35:40,402 --> 00:35:42,259
So, I feel like I have lived in the house.

454
00:35:44,115 --> 00:35:47,739
Where are they? Are they upstairs?

455
00:36:00,782 --> 00:36:04,615
My dearest wife.

456
00:36:04,615 --> 00:36:07,960
Happy birthday.

457
00:36:10,021 --> 00:36:12,456
Her breasts? Let me see.

458
00:36:12,456 --> 00:36:13,940
No. I don't want that.

459
00:36:13,940 --> 00:36:15,326
- What do you want to see?
- Eun Seo.

460
00:36:15,326 --> 00:36:16,575
Jun Seo.

461
00:36:18,155 --> 00:36:20,822
- Mom, stop him.
- Come here and sit.

462
00:36:20,822 --> 00:36:22,543
Sit here and stop making a fuss.

463
00:36:23,989 --> 00:36:26,312
Mom, the one I love the most. Bye.

464
00:36:30,311 --> 00:36:31,311
And,

465
00:36:35,619 --> 00:36:37,966
Jun Seo, goodbye.

466
00:36:42,643 --> 00:36:44,061
They're not upstairs.

467
00:36:46,490 --> 00:36:48,821
- Han Tae Seok, When did you come?
- Hi.

468
00:36:53,036 --> 00:36:54,036
Eun Seo.

469
00:36:57,972 --> 00:36:59,118
Jun Seo.

470
00:37:04,131 --> 00:37:05,600
- Eun Seo.
- Choi Eun Seo.

471
00:37:28,335 --> 00:37:29,895
I think it is because of me.

472
00:37:33,301 --> 00:37:36,391
I told her I like her.

473
00:38:03,177 --> 00:38:05,548
(Yoon Eun Seo's Room)

474
00:38:15,047 --> 00:38:17,361
I should cry again.
Isn't that what you thought?

475
00:38:21,697 --> 00:38:25,034
Nothing has changed.
Isn't that what you thought?

476
00:38:26,841 --> 00:38:30,483
She is crying like a fool.
Isn't that what you thought?

477
00:38:33,871 --> 00:38:36,834
She must be speaking casually now.
Isn't that what you thought?

478
00:38:40,253 --> 00:38:43,968
Finally, she is like Eun Seo.
Isn't that what you thought?

479
00:38:50,301 --> 00:38:51,424
Are you Eun Seo?

480
00:38:54,270 --> 00:38:55,543
Yes, I am. Jun Seo.

481
00:38:58,253 --> 00:39:01,665
Jun Seo.

482
00:39:19,377 --> 00:39:21,981
I think you were very close to Jun Seo.

483
00:39:24,417 --> 00:39:25,417
Yes.

484
00:39:27,210 --> 00:39:28,580
How did you meet him?

485
00:39:29,273 --> 00:39:32,449
We studied art in New York.

486
00:39:32,449 --> 00:39:35,201
I was a friend of Tae Seok.

487
00:39:35,201 --> 00:39:37,773
I met Jun Seo as a friend
through Tae Seok.

488
00:39:40,641 --> 00:39:43,226
It was interesting when we first met.

489
00:39:43,226 --> 00:39:46,770
He didn't talk to me at all during dinner.

490
00:39:46,770 --> 00:39:49,533
So I figured he wasn't
interested in me at all.

491
00:39:50,178 --> 00:39:52,754
After dinner, he asked me...

492
00:39:52,754 --> 00:39:56,100
what I wanted to be
if I were to be born again.

493
00:39:57,946 --> 00:40:00,621
So, what did you say?

494
00:40:01,344 --> 00:40:04,156
Tree. I said tree.

495
00:40:10,874 --> 00:40:12,069
I...

496
00:40:14,146 --> 00:40:15,422
I will be a tree.

497
00:40:17,130 --> 00:40:18,361
A tree?

498
00:40:18,361 --> 00:40:20,511
Yes, a tree.

499
00:40:20,511 --> 00:40:22,496
Once it has taken root,

500
00:40:22,496 --> 00:40:24,748
it can't move anywhere else.
I want to be such a tree.

501
00:40:26,913 --> 00:40:29,763
That was our first time.

502
00:40:32,608 --> 00:40:33,723
What?

503
00:40:34,793 --> 00:40:37,595
I told her I like her.

504
00:40:38,625 --> 00:40:39,757
I told her I mean it.

505
00:40:41,064 --> 00:40:42,327
Tae Seok.

506
00:40:42,327 --> 00:40:44,211
I don't like being serious,

507
00:40:44,961 --> 00:40:46,131
but this is genuine.

508
00:40:47,016 --> 00:40:49,796
I like Eun Seo a lot.

509
00:40:53,089 --> 00:40:54,258
What did she say?

510
00:40:55,561 --> 00:40:57,744
She didn't say anything.

511
00:40:57,744 --> 00:40:59,303
But you will see.

512
00:40:59,303 --> 00:41:02,609
I will let her know I am the only man
who can make her happy.

513
00:41:03,657 --> 00:41:06,930
What do you think?
Am I good enough to go out with Eun Seo?

514
00:41:11,345 --> 00:41:12,836
If I were to say no,

515
00:41:14,032 --> 00:41:15,908
will you not go out with her?

516
00:41:15,908 --> 00:41:17,498
I will still go out with her.

517
00:41:17,498 --> 00:41:19,266
I'm not telling you this
to ask for your permission.

518
00:41:19,266 --> 00:41:24,505
But, as my best friend and her cousin,

519
00:41:24,505 --> 00:41:25,922
will you be happy for us?

520
00:41:45,778 --> 00:41:47,772
Who made it?

521
00:41:47,772 --> 00:41:50,498
- Did you cook?
- Yu Mi did.

522
00:41:52,000 --> 00:41:53,875
- Is it good?
- It is tasty.

523
00:41:55,059 --> 00:41:57,819
Why don't we spend the night here?

524
00:41:57,819 --> 00:41:59,074
I would like that.

525
00:41:59,074 --> 00:42:00,974
How about you, Eun Seo?
Is that okay with you?

526
00:42:02,293 --> 00:42:05,012
By the way, on which side are you cousins?

527
00:42:05,012 --> 00:42:06,328
On your father's side
or your mother's side?

528
00:42:09,060 --> 00:42:10,782
Why are you so curious about that?

529
00:42:10,782 --> 00:42:13,800
Since your names are Eun Seo and Jun Seo,
I guess you're paternal cousins.

530
00:42:14,309 --> 00:42:17,181
Yes. What did you talk about earlier?

531
00:42:17,181 --> 00:42:20,325
We talked about when we first met.

532
00:42:20,325 --> 00:42:22,630
I see.

533
00:42:22,630 --> 00:42:25,766
"If I were to be born again,
I would want to be a tree."

534
00:42:28,135 --> 00:42:30,451
What do you want to be, Eun Seo?

535
00:42:39,113 --> 00:42:40,498
I want to be Jun Seo's sister.

536
00:42:42,880 --> 00:42:45,056
That is quite something.

537
00:42:45,056 --> 00:42:46,322
Good for you, Yoon Jun Seo.

538
00:42:53,435 --> 00:42:54,614
Choi Eun Seo.

539
00:42:55,812 --> 00:42:57,367
Do you want to know how to catch a fish?

540
00:42:57,367 --> 00:42:58,704
I need to clean up with them.

541
00:42:58,704 --> 00:43:01,404
They will do it. Yu Mi.

542
00:43:01,404 --> 00:43:02,975
Please take care of this.

543
00:43:07,228 --> 00:43:09,629
Do you see this line? When you untie it,
the fishing line comes out.

544
00:43:09,629 --> 00:43:12,124
If you do it this way,
the fish line stays.

545
00:43:12,124 --> 00:43:13,188
And...

546
00:43:13,980 --> 00:43:16,058
That is not how you do it.
You do it this way...

547
00:43:16,058 --> 00:43:17,744
and turn it this way.

548
00:43:19,220 --> 00:43:20,492
That is correct.

549
00:43:20,492 --> 00:43:23,543
I'm not familiar with this
since it is a new product.

550
00:43:32,717 --> 00:43:33,717
Are you cold?

551
00:43:36,462 --> 00:43:38,374
- No, I am fine.
- It is all right.

552
00:43:45,017 --> 00:43:46,420
It is hot.

553
00:43:49,530 --> 00:43:53,659
They look great together.
Don't you think so, Jun Seo?

554
00:44:21,923 --> 00:44:23,548
It is good to have Jun Seo's clothes.

555
00:44:24,523 --> 00:44:27,755
Why are you alone?

556
00:44:27,755 --> 00:44:28,908
Well.

557
00:44:28,908 --> 00:44:30,827
Jun Seo went for a walk.

558
00:44:30,827 --> 00:44:33,509
Do you know where Eun Seo is?

559
00:44:34,997 --> 00:44:36,023
I don't know.

560
00:45:11,046 --> 00:45:13,400
You cried so much here.

561
00:45:15,910 --> 00:45:17,153
Did I?

562
00:45:19,077 --> 00:45:23,649
Whenever you disappeared,
you were always here crying.

563
00:45:26,717 --> 00:45:27,717
Did I?

564
00:45:28,751 --> 00:45:29,832
You did.

565
00:45:31,838 --> 00:45:34,713
We passed by this street
on a bike every day.

566
00:45:36,302 --> 00:45:38,466
We stopped here when
we were stuck in the rain.

567
00:45:39,886 --> 00:45:40,953
Did we?

568
00:45:43,053 --> 00:45:44,506
Don't you remember it?

569
00:45:46,006 --> 00:45:47,273
Do you remember me?

570
00:45:55,591 --> 00:45:59,439
I don't remember that much.

571
00:46:01,038 --> 00:46:02,744
Everything is a blur.

572
00:46:06,166 --> 00:46:08,376
I have tried so hard to forget.

573
00:46:10,606 --> 00:46:14,177
When I thought of those times,

574
00:46:15,791 --> 00:46:17,873
there were many happy moments.

575
00:46:19,831 --> 00:46:21,873
But I'm not happy now.
That makes me jealous.

576
00:46:23,190 --> 00:46:25,352
I decided to forget it all
because I was envious of the old times.

577
00:46:27,894 --> 00:46:32,404
I really did forget everything.

578
00:46:32,404 --> 00:46:33,404
Didn't I?

579
00:46:41,829 --> 00:46:43,072
Jun Seo.

580
00:46:45,454 --> 00:46:46,847
To tell you the truth...

581
00:46:48,861 --> 00:46:53,063
It has been so hard for me.

582
00:46:56,045 --> 00:47:00,368
I didn't even want to recall
those good memories with you and Mom,

583
00:47:02,134 --> 00:47:05,488
that's how hard it has been.

584
00:47:07,366 --> 00:47:08,744
It was hard.

585
00:47:36,770 --> 00:47:39,836
It has been a long time,
but can I give you a piggyback?

586
00:47:39,836 --> 00:47:41,936
- Come on.
- No, Jun Seo.

587
00:47:42,487 --> 00:47:45,920
Come on. Get on while I'm being nice.
Get on my back.

588
00:47:48,552 --> 00:47:50,160
You are keeping me waiting forever.

589
00:47:52,154 --> 00:47:53,237
What are you doing?

590
00:47:56,286 --> 00:47:58,656
Why aren't they coming back yet?

591
00:47:59,277 --> 00:48:02,982
Jun Seo is fine,
but I'm worried about Eun Seo.

592
00:48:02,982 --> 00:48:04,392
I know.

593
00:48:11,511 --> 00:48:12,511
Are you Eun Seo?

594
00:48:15,651 --> 00:48:16,924
Are you?

595
00:48:16,924 --> 00:48:19,452
Yu Mi. Tae Seok.

596
00:48:19,452 --> 00:48:20,455
Yoon Sin Ae.

597
00:48:22,571 --> 00:48:25,384
- Sin Ae.
- I missed you.

598
00:48:25,384 --> 00:48:27,230
Why didn't you call us?

599
00:48:27,230 --> 00:48:29,048
You haven't changed.

600
00:48:31,124 --> 00:48:32,427
Am I not heavy?

601
00:48:33,346 --> 00:48:34,346
No.

602
00:48:35,455 --> 00:48:36,738
I think I'm heavy.

603
00:48:40,743 --> 00:48:42,491
Am I the third one now?

604
00:48:44,864 --> 00:48:50,995
Besides Mom, Yu Mi, Sin Ae.
Is it me after that?

605
00:48:54,721 --> 00:48:56,259
You're not the third one.

606
00:48:57,599 --> 00:49:00,319
Am I not even the third? You are mean.

607
00:49:02,157 --> 00:49:03,157
What about you?

608
00:49:04,916 --> 00:49:06,559
Where am I on your list?

609
00:49:07,421 --> 00:49:09,084
You know where you are.

610
00:49:10,532 --> 00:49:11,973
Do I?

611
00:49:11,973 --> 00:49:14,273
You are on the top, of course.

612
00:49:23,342 --> 00:49:26,304
Let me get off. You must be tired.

613
00:49:47,048 --> 00:49:49,918
What are you talking about?
What do you mean by his cousin?

614
00:49:49,918 --> 00:49:51,098
Who is his cousin?

615
00:49:51,678 --> 00:49:52,864
I'm sorry for being late...

616
00:49:52,864 --> 00:49:53,864
Jun Seo.

617
00:50:24,660 --> 00:50:27,888
I can't live without you now. Come to me.

618
00:50:29,397 --> 00:50:31,054
I need to talk to you, Yu Mi.

619
00:50:31,668 --> 00:50:33,320
Don't you love me?

620
00:50:33,958 --> 00:50:36,063
I thought I could try to.

621
00:50:36,558 --> 00:50:38,956
Eun Seo, please help me out.

622
00:50:38,956 --> 00:50:42,701
I am nothing without Jun Seo.

623
00:50:44,550 --> 00:50:46,556
Let me have you, too.

624
00:50:46,556 --> 00:50:47,918
You can trust me.

625
00:50:48,396 --> 00:50:50,650
Let's forget that we even met.

626
00:50:50,650 --> 00:50:52,504
Only then can we all be happy.

627
00:50:53,747 --> 00:50:54,822
Don't leave.

628
00:50:57,242 --> 00:50:58,983
I won't let you leave.
